  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có véc-tơ chỉ phương <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, chọn một véc-tơ chỉ phương <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> qua <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> có phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/8446c08196ac83ad0e8de0c7c332f3d94263375801fc8f5c55062fa97a5fbd14.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>\n\t\t\n\t\tGọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, vật cách điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> một khoảng ngắn nhất khi và chỉ khi vật đang ở điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Ta có\n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>13</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>23</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>13</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>23</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>13</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>13</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy vật cách điểm xuất phát <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> một khoảng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></semantics></math> đơn vị.",
